   "title": "Korea's exports forecast to exceed $1 tril. for 2nd straight year in 2027",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261123/koreas-exports-forecast-to-exceed-1-tril-for-2nd-straight-year-in-2027",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
