   "title": "Unification minister, Mongolian FM vow closer cooperation for peace on Korean Peninsula",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/others/20261123/unification-minister-mongolian-fm-vow-closer-cooperation-for-peace-on-korean-peninsula",
