   "_dt": 1795429622.0,
   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "Chung Dong-young on Monday asked Mongolia to support peace on the Korean Peninsula, citing its friendly ties with the two Koreas, during a meeting with Mongolian Foreign Minister Batmunkh Battsetseg, the ministry said. Chung noted Mongolia's efforts to promote regional peace and thanked Battsetseg for the warm welcome he received in June when he visited the country to attend the 11th Ulaanbaatar Dialogue on Northeast Asian Security.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国青丁佑周一在与蒙古外长巴特蒙赫·巴特谢塞格会晤时表示，希望蒙古支持朝鲜半岛和平，并援引蒙古与朝鲜、韩国两国的友好关系。外交部称，青丁佑提到蒙古为推动地区和平作出的努力，并感谢巴特谢塞格在6月他访问蒙古、出席第11届乌兰巴托东北亚安全对话时给予的热烈欢迎。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Unification Minister Chung Dong-young on Monday asked Mongolia to support peace on the Korean Peninsula, citing its friendly ties with the two Koreas, during a meeting with Mongolian Foreign Minister Batmunkh Battsetseg, the ministry said. Chung noted Mongolia's efforts to promote regional peace and thanked Battsetseg for the warm welcome he received in June when he visited the country to attend the 11th Ulaanbaatar Dialogue on Northeast Asian Security. Describing bilateral relations as entering an \"age of gold,\" he expressed hope that the two countries will keep deepening mutual ties. Battsetseg also vowed to continue close cooperation with Seoul in its push for peaceful coexistence on the peninsula, according to the ministry",
