   "title": "NC raises 2026 sales forecast on Lineage Classic success",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261123/nc-raises-2026-sales-forecast-on-lineage-classic-success",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
