   "title": "Daily share buyback limit to be lifted for 3 months amid market rout",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261123/daily-share-buyback-limit-to-be-lifted-for-3-months-amid-market-rout",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
